 - Strategy is behavioral design pattern that lets us define family of algoritham and make them interchangable.
 - It put each algorithman in separate class
 - Strategy apply if class does something specific in lot of ways and extract all of these algorithm into separte class
 - Original class called context; which has reference field to store one of the startegy

 Example:
  - Lets say we wanted to add different payment strategy and wanted to select at run time
  - UPI Payment
  - Net Banking Payment
  - Credit Card Payment 